  "notes": "Two sheets side by side, drawn rotated 90 degrees (codes CA94001/C901CYP1 and CA94001/C901CYP2). P1: all odd pins 1-39 bracketed as 24V COM; even pins carry the single-ended outputs (PGM 1 MUSIC / VOICE, PGM 2-4, MIX-MINUS, AUX 1, AUX 2, CUE) and 40 = 24V COM, so each output's return is the neighbouring 24V COM. P2: balanced A / B stereo inputs (+ on odd, - on even), shields 9-10, L / R inserts and direct outs, control and tally lines, mute / cue / timer buses (doubled on both rows), power -24V 49-50, 24V COMMON 51-52, +24V 53-54, CHASSIS 55-56. Single-ended signals are recorded as '+'. Control directions inferred from names. Legend: NC not connected, IC internally connected. No date / title block on the sheet (file name says 1994)."
}
